{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20021463,"chapterID":15000605,"chapterNumber":"VI-5","sectionNumber":"65-31","title":"Temporary Uses","officialText":"","previewText":"In all districts, where the provisions of this Section are utilized, the use provisions of this Resolution, including any supplemental use regulations and provisions regulating size limitations, change of non-conforming uses, enlargement or extension of non-conforming uses, shall be modified to allow a temporary non-conforming use to be created, and a non-conforming use to be enlarged or extended, on a temporary basi","blocks":[{"id":"zr-21463-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In all districts, where the provisions of this Section are utilized, the <strong><em>use</em></strong> provisions of this Resolution, including any supplemental use regulations and provisions regulating size limitations, change of <strong><em>non-conforming</em></strong> <strong><em>uses</em></strong>, <strong><em>enlargement</em></strong> or <strong><em>extension</em></strong> of <strong><em>non-conforming</em></strong> <strong><em>uses</em></strong>, shall be modified to allow a temporary <strong><em>non-conforming</em></strong> <strong><em>use</em></strong> to be created, and a <strong><em>non-conforming use</em></strong> to be <strong><em>enlarged</em></strong> or <strong><em>extended</em></strong>, on a temporary basis, to aid in the immediate restoration and recovery of an area adversely impacted by a <strong><em>severe disaster</em></strong>.</span></p>","plainText":"In all districts, where the provisions of this Section are utilized, the use provisions of this Resolution, including any supplemental use regulations and provisions regulating size limitations, change of non-conforming uses, enlargement or extension of non-conforming uses, shall be modified to allow a temporary non-conforming use to be created, and a non-conforming use to be enlarged or extended, on a temporary basis, to aid in the immediate restoration and recovery of an area adversely impacted by a severe disaster."},{"id":"zr-21463-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>The creation of a new <strong><em>non-conforming</em></strong> <strong><em>use</em></strong> shall be subject to the following limitations:</span></p>","plainText":"The creation of a new non-conforming use shall be subject to the following limitations:"},{"id":"zr-21463-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<a id=\"t.fc633c07f2512e8bcd46ef7f2e332b731a1929fa\"></a>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-21463-block-004","kind":"html","html":"<a id=\"t.1\"></a>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-21463-block-005","kind":"table","html":"<table style=\"margin-left:-5.4pt;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;margin-right:auto\"><tbody><tr style=\"height:16pt\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:116.8pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\"><p><span><strong><em>Severe Disaster</em></strong></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:85.4pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\"><p><span>District</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-r